      "justification": "Patient has known comorbidity of cardiac tamponade, a reversible cause of PEA arrest (one of the 'H's and T's'). Identifying and treating reversible causes is a core AHA ACLS requirement for PEA/asystole management. Cardiac tamponade (T for Tamponade) should be urgently identified and addressed."
    },
